  <summary>A standalone desktop editor for Markdown and MDX</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      Fulvid is a standalone desktop editor for Markdown and MDX. The file on
      disk is the source of truth. Monaco is the live editor. MDX is not
      executed. Preview is inert Markdown.
    </p>
    <p>
      Open a file or a folder with the native dialogs. Edit locally. There is
      no account, no cloud service, and no plugin platform.
